## Import

Import uses `collection_id/group_id`, with exactly one slash and two canonical lowercase, nonzero UUIDs in that order. Do not use a collection name, short URL ID, group name, or the server's grant-row UUID. Replace both placeholder UUIDs with the existing pair's IDs.

{{ codefile "shell" .ImportFile }}

Configure `collection_id` and `group_id` to match the imported pair. If those IDs reference managed parent resources, import the parents first or use data sources for parents Terraform should not manage. Import discovers the grant's current permission and reads it into state without changing the grant. Set the required `permission` to that value before applying to retain it, or review the planned permission change. Omission is invalid, not an instruction to leave access unmanaged.

See the [import guide](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/glitchedmob/outline/latest/docs/guides/import) for the other import formats.
